  "details": "@galicia-toolkit/tag-manager claims the `@galicia-toolkit` scope and describes itself as a dependency-confusion PoC. Its postinstall hook runs `node postinstall.js || true` on npm install; the script collects host, platform, runtime, network, and environment data, then sends it over HTTP to `oob.s4yhii.com:9999` and encodes hostname, username, platform, and architecture in DNS queries to subdomains of `oob.s4yhii.com`. The npm account s4yhii_ published versions 999.0.3 and 999.0.5 on 2026-10-08; 999.0.6 runs the same `node postinstall.js || true` command on install, sends the same DNS queries, and connects to `66.94.100.203:9999`.",
